msgstr "$ l'heure, elles vaudraient"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid ". The rate is set in the settings, Budgets section."
msgstr ""
".\n"
"                        Le taux se règle dans les paramètres, section Budgets."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#. modules: bf_budget_campaign, bf_budget_forecast
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid "Actual"
msgstr "Réalisé"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_total_estimated
msgid ""
"Actual spend plus the estimate of uncosted hours. Not to be confused with "
"total spend, which carries actuals only."
msgstr ""
"La dépense réelle plus l'estimation des heures non valorisées. À ne pas "
"confondre avec la dépense totale, qui ne porte que du réel."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__analytic_account_id
msgid "Analytic account"
msgstr "Compte analytique"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_internal
msgid ""
"Analytic lines WITHOUT a journal entry: timesheets and manual entries. "
"Separate from posted spend."
msgstr ""
"Les lignes analytiques SANS pièce comptable : feuilles de temps et saisies "
"manuelles. Disjoint de la dépense comptabilisée."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_accounting
msgid ""
"Analytic lines backed by a journal entry. This is the money spent, taxes "
"included, as the general ledger records it."
msgstr ""
"Les lignes analytiques adossées à une écriture comptable. C'est l'argent "
"sorti, taxes comprises, tel que le grand livre le porte."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid "Assignment"
msgstr "Rattachement"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_has_unvalued_time
msgid "Bf Has Unvalued Time"
msgstr "A des heures non valorisées"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
