msgstr "Taux de revient par défaut"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid "Estimate of uncosted hours"
msgstr "Estimation des heures non valorisées"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_internal_estimated
msgid "Estimated internal cost"
msgstr "Coût interne estimé"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_total_estimated
msgid "Estimated total spend"
msgstr "Dépense totale estimée"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_estimate_rate
msgid "Estimation rate"
msgstr "Taux d'estimation"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_internal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_tree_budget
msgid "Internal cost"
msgstr "Coût interne"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_hours_internal
msgid "Internal hours"
msgstr "Heures internes"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_unvalued_hours
msgid ""
"Logged hours whose cost is zero. Odoo costs time at the employee's hourly "
"cost: when that rate is missing, the campaign reads zero and looks perfectly"
" normal."
msgstr ""
"Heures saisies dont le coût est nul. Odoo valorise le temps au coût horaire "
"de l'employé : quand ce taux manque, la campagne lit zéro et a l'air "
"parfaitement normale."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_amount_planned
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid "Planned"
msgstr "Prévu"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_tree_budget
msgid "Posted"
msgstr "Comptabilisée"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_accounting
msgid "Posted spend"
msgstr "Dépense comptabilisée"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid "Spend"
msgstr "Dépense"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_budget_campaign/models/campagne.py:0
msgid ""
"The \"%(compte)s\" account belongs to the \"%(plan)s\" plan, a root plan "
"separate from the project plan. Analytic lines of such a plan are stored in "
"another column, and the campaign's spend would silently stay at zero. Move "
"this plan under the project plan, or choose an account from the project "
"plan."
msgstr ""
"Le compte « %(compte)s » appartient au plan « %(plan)s », un plan racine "
"distinct du plan projet. Les lignes analytiques d'un tel plan sont rangées "
"dans une autre colonne, et la dépense de la campagne resterait à zéro sans "
"le dire. Rangez ce plan sous le plan projet, ou choisissez un compte du plan"
" projet."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__analytic_account_id
msgid ""
"The account that carries this campaign's spend. An expense charged to this "
"account shows up here with no double entry."
msgstr ""
"Le compte qui porte la dépense de cette campagne. Une dépense imputée à ce "
"compte remonte ici sans double saisie."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_budget_line_ids
msgid "The budget lines whose analytic axis names this campaign's account."
msgstr ""
"Les lignes budgétaires dont l'axe analytique nomme le compte de cette "
"campagne."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_estimate_rate
msgid ""
"The default cost rate set for this instance. It only applies to hours with "
"no hourly cost."
msgstr ""
"Le taux de revient par défaut réglé pour cette instance. Il ne sert qu'aux "
"heures sans coût horaire."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_budget_campaign/models/campagne.py:0
msgid ""
"The project analytic plan cannot be found. Odoo points to it with the "
"\"analytic.project_plan\" system parameter; without it, there is no way to "
"know which plan to put campaigns under."
msgstr ""
"Le plan analytique projet est introuvable. Odoo le désigne par le paramètre "
"système « analytic.project_plan » ; sans lui, on ne sait pas sous quel plan "
"ranger les campagnes."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_budget_campaign.constraint_utm_campaign_analytic_account_uniq
msgid ""
"This analytic account is already used by another campaign. An account can "
"carry only one campaign, otherwise both would show the same spend."
msgstr ""
"Ce compte analytique sert déjà une autre campagne. Un compte ne peut porter "
"qu'une campagne, sans quoi les deux afficheraient la même dépense."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid ""
"This campaign has no analytic account. Without one, no expense can be "
"charged to it: Odoo knows what the campaign brought in, never what it cost."
msgstr ""
"Cette campagne n'a pas de compte analytique. Sans lui,\n"
"                        aucune dépense ne peut lui être imputée : Odoo sait ce que\n"
"                        la campagne a rapporté, jamais ce qu'elle a coûté."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_total
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_tree_budget
msgid "Total spend"
msgstr "Dépense totale"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_unvalued_hours
msgid "Uncosted hours"
msgstr "Heures non valorisées"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_utm_campaign__bf_cost_internal_estimated
msgid ""
"Uncosted hours at the default rate. It is an estimate, never a posted "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"Les heures non valorisées, au taux par défaut. C'est une estimation, jamais "
"un montant comptabilisé."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_budget_campaign.field_res_config_settings__bf_campaign_hourly_cost
msgid ""
"Used ONLY to estimate the hours Odoo could not cost, for lack of an hourly "
"cost on the employee record. The estimate is shown separately and never "
"enters actual spend."
msgstr ""
"Sert UNIQUEMENT à estimer les heures qu'Odoo n'a pas pu valoriser, faute de "
"coût horaire sur la fiche employé. L'estimation est affichée à part et "
"n'entre jamais dans la dépense réelle."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.res_config_settings_view_form_campaign
msgid ""
"Used only to estimate the hours Odoo could not cost, for lack of an hourly "
"cost on the employee record. The estimate stays separate and never enters "
"actual spend."
msgstr ""
"Sert uniquement à estimer les heures qu'Odoo n'a pas pu valoriser, faute de "
"coût horaire sur la fiche employé. L'estimation reste affichée à part et "
"n'entre jamais dans la dépense réelle."

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid "Variance from plan"
msgstr "Écart au plan"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_search_budget
msgid "Without an analytic account"
msgstr "Sans compte analytique"

#. module: bf_budget_campaign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_budget_campaign.utm_campaign_view_form_budget
msgid ""
"hours are charged to this campaign with no hourly cost on the employee "
"record, so they are not counted in actual spend. Estimated at the default "
"rate of"
msgstr ""
"d'heures sont imputées à cette campagne sans coût horaire sur\n"
"                        la fiche employé. Elles ne comptent donc pas dans la dépense\n"
"                        réelle. Estimées au taux par défaut de"
